[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Super Splat and announced initial support for Lickfeld Studio, Vario\'s Teleport, and Xgrids. Nuke 17.1 moved from open beta and shipped initial support for animated Gaussian splats in addition to basic relighting directly inside of Nuke. Users of Maya will be'

[00:38] [scene:talk]
